(4 or 8 mg/kg). The survival of bone marrow cells was assessed by the spleen colony assay. Results are means&#x000b1;S.E. for six mice.</p></caption><graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" mime-subtype="gif" xlink:href="87-6600561f1"/></fig></sec></body></article>